      "about": "the hi-vis colour: buttons, the brand chevron, live readouts, stage ticks, the inspection scan and its tags, the map's rings and home, checked boxes and slots"
    }
  },
  "checks": {
    "lightness": [
      { "path": "theme.accent", "range": [0.42, 0.66] }
